WEBVTT

00:01:57.630 --> 00:02:02.510
<i>It has been three days since the collapse
of the symbol of Bayron City, the Legeston Hotel,</i>

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:04.520
EPISODE 2
THE ISLAND OF DESIRE

00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:06.100
<i>but we still haven't figured out
the reason why the accident happened.</i>

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:07.600
LEGESTON HOTEL
COLLAPSED

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:08.100
<i>We have Fujita at the accident site.</i>

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:09.480
WHY DID A LUXURY HOTEL COLLAPSE?
TENSION REMAINS AS THE AREA CONTINUES TO BE OFF-LIMITS

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:11.610
<i>Yes. The police's opinion is that
this doesn't seem like a criminal incident.</i>

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:14.110
<i>They are handling the matter carefully,
seeing if there were any problems</i>

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:16.280
<i>with the building's
architecture or construction.</i>

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:19.490
As always, they do a marvelous cover-up job.

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:26.500
IT'S DARK.
SO IT MIGHT BE
AT NIGHT!?

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:26.500
NOT SURE
WHERE IT IS.
COULD BE
AN ALLEYWAY.

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:26.500
WEARING
A HOODIE!

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:26.500
FACE NOT VISIBLE...

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:22.620
Kisara, what about this guy's face?

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:26.500
That was about all that was left
in the memory of the Demon Possession.

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:30.460
Or rather, the memory was awfully
fuzzy about that in particular.

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:34.800
What are you doing?

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.840
Huh? I'm checking
the fiscal status of our company.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:37.840
This month's living expense breakdown
(*Don't throw receipts away!
*Always enter data when you shop!!)

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.890
Did I ask you to do that?

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:43.100
I mean, since we're living together...

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:48.020
I have to take proper care
of your health and your finances!

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:50.900
No, I only gave you a spare key.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:54.190
I never said we'd be living together.

00:02:56.690 --> 00:03:00.400
It might be a bit rough this month
unless we get a part-time job.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:04.200
We cut into most of my savings
with what we bought the other day.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:08.700
We'll be fine. Today is the much-anticipated
end of the month. Which means...

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.960
my invoice from that earlier job
should be deposited into my account!

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:14.920
The deposit is at the end of next month.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:16.920
Huh?

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:20.010
Deposits from government offices
are always in the following month.

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.760
Every job we've taken in the past
was like that, too.

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:23.470
Seriously?

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:26.970
We'll be fine.

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:30.230
You have nothing to worry about.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:35.480
Though, we might be eating nothing but bean sprouts
all the way until the end of next month.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:40.030
Seriously?

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:45.370
HOURLY RATE:
$8.97~18.25

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:45.370
FILLING A BAG
WITH RIBBONS
AND FRILLS

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:46.490
HOURLY RATE:
$8.99~17.99

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:46.490
APPLYING
DM ADDRESS STICKERS

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:47.870
ASSEMBLING
BALLPOINT PENS
AND MECHANICAL PENCILS

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:47.870
HOURLY RATE:
$9.99~19.99

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:51.660
Naturally, a secret girlfriend
has to get a side job for money.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:52.960
Looking for a part-time job?

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.380
Hey, good morning!

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.840
Huh? What are you buying?
Or are you going on a trip?

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:58.590
Nope.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.260
I have no room for luxuries right now.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.630
That reminds me how you said...

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:06.180
your boyfriend's always in financial trouble
because he has no money, but you can't be...

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:09.220
Oh? Kisara, what's this?

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.440
Th-This is different.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:16.440
I-It can't be from your boyfriend?

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:17.980
Then,

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:22.950
he forced you to do lewd work so he can repay
his debt, and when you said no, he slapped you?

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:26.780
That so sounds like a secret girlfriend.
Sounds good.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.580
You know, you should call
your boyfriend out here right now!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.790
I won't be satisfied
until I give him a piece of my mind!

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:35.960
What? But it's a DV kind of boyfriend,
so isn't it scary to face him with just us girls?

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.670
H-He's not that scary!

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:41.670
He's usually a really kind guy, you know.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:45.930
Oh man, this is a hopeless case.
This is what you call "codependence."

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:49.510
No, oh no! We must not allow
a man like that around!

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:56.400
Hachisuka-senpai...

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.980
Don't be such a stranger, Kisara!

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.360
Why didn't you consult me about all this?

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:08.620
More like, is there even a need
to be consulting you?

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:12.160
The student council president is the president
for each and every student!

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:12.160
EVERYONE'S PRESIDENT

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:15.040
Everyone's troubles are my own troubles!

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.040
TROUBLES

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.750
Not just for problems within the academy

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:19.790
GRADES
EXTRA CLASSES
CLEANING
LAUNDRY
TUITION
NUTRITIONAL BALANCE
UNREQUITED LOVE
ILLICIT LOVE
CLUB CRASHERS
FUTURE PATH
LOVE TRIANGLE
FOLLOW-UP EXAMS
SOCIAL MEDIA

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:19.790
but also for family matters and sour relationships!

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.380
I, the eldest son
of Bayron City Mayor Masataka Hachisuka,

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.930
the most likely
to become the next mayor,

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:27.590
Mikhail Hachisuka,

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:31.640
will pinpoint your problem
and solve it for you!

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:36.600
Um, about the swimming team budget
that we've already submitted—

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:36.600
Oh Kisara...

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:41.360
Someone as lovely as you
being mistreated by some lowlife man...

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.280
I cannot endure such a fate!

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:46.820
Oh, is this world bereft of gods and demons?

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:49.200
He pinpointed your request
as one to ignore.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.740
Oh, that's right.

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:55.000
All that aside, there's going to be
a party tonight hosted by the city.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.290
Kisara, would you like to join me?

00:05:57.290 --> 00:06:01.500
I'll prepare a dress for you
and pick you up in the early evening...

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:08.220
Mikhail-senpai's still as disappointing as ever.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:11.300
He's handsome, he's the student council
president, and he's rich.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.930
Heaven gave him two, no, three gifts.

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:16.850
I wonder why he isn't popular
with girls despite all that.

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:20.230
Oh, anyone who talks to him
for 30 seconds would know why.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:24.480
MAYOR'S PRESS CONFERENCE
ON THE NEXT-GENERATION
ENERGY SOURCES

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:24.480
Even though he's the son
of that shrewd mayor.

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:29.610
It's true that there are some
ill-natured places in our industry.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:33.870
Like some that just get a contract
and give absolutely no support afterwards.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:39.870
But our policy is to fully support
our contracts from beginning to end.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:45.130
And now you want to come in
as a subcontractor to us instead?

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:51.140
I'm sure AAA is brimming with work! I won't
limit myself to Demon Hazard stuff, either.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:57.600
Security for cash transports, traffic guidance
for road construction... I'll do anything!

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:58.600
What happened to your...

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:03.400
"I've made up my mind to only do the jobs
I should be doing from now on. Smirk!" thing?

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:07.440
Come on, stop finding faults with me, Ayano.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:12.110
That wheedling voice that completely
lacks sincerity irritates me!

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:16.540
I don't think I've changed
how I speak at all though.

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:21.040
What I mean is,
you always have irritated me!

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:25.880
In the first place, wouldn't that girl
pout again if you came running to me?

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:31.430
Indeed! Kisara would pout if she found out
I bowed my head down to you!

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:35.720
But you can tell how sincere I'm being
because I decided to come here first and foremost!

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:37.970
Not only is it how you talk,

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:41.480
but what you talk about completely
lacks sincerity. That's actually amazing.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:46.940
No, I'm really begging you!
This time, I'm in serious trouble!

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:50.780
Living a whole month absolutely penniless
is in the zone of the unknown even for me!

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:51.740
Shut up!

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:55.950
Come on, don't sound so indifferent!

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:56.700
Huh?

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:58.870
I'm going to consult my mom.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.040
I mean the company president.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:02.750
So stay quiet for a bit!

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:07.130
Ayano!

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:12.590
Really, I'm getting really sick
of just how hopeless I am—

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:17.300
Huh?

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:19.930
What's wrong?

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:22.690
We're going to start living together

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:25.560
H-Huh?

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:30.900
SHOWER ROOM
SAUNA ROOM

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:30.900
POOL
DANCE ROOM

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:30.280
Wait!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:33.990
Ayano, why are you following Kisara?

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.200
Look over here, please!

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:42.450
25th ANNIVERSARY PARTY
OF BAYRON CITY MUNICIPAL GOVERNMENT

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:47.540
We acknowledge that this person
 is a student at our school.

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:47.540
STUDENT ID
BAYRON INSTITUTE OF TECHNOLOGY
STUDENT NUMBER: 113004505647
COURSE: MECHANICAL ENGINEERING
NAME: YOSHITO KASHIMA

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:44.790
Yoshito Kashima.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.540
He's an eighth-year student
at Bayron Institute of Technology.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:52.800
This student is planning for an assassination
of the mayor at tonight's party?

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:52.800
Bayron City Deputy Mayor
Linfa Hachisuka

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:52.800
Bayron City Deputy Mayor
Shenfa Hachisuka

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:58.430
I cannot confirm, but one of my men
seized documents for such a plan

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:02.520
from this student's apartment
moments ago.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.440
Why is the Anti-Demon Bureau involved?

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:10.520
Wasn't your division in charge of handling
Demon Hazards and not exposition of terrorists?

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:16.490
Indeed so. We had our marks on him
as a suspect of Demon Possession.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:20.200
We found out about the assassination plan
completely by coincidence.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:25.790
And? What does the police want us to do?

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:31.800
Actually, the Securities Bureau chief requested
that tonight's party be postponed or canceled—

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:33.920
That's impossible. Absolutely impossible.

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:36.090
I figured.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:42.140
To give in to terrorism counters
the purpose of today's celebration, as well.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.930
Father... No...

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:47.690
the mayor would never
nod in agreement to such a thing.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:53.280
Then, can you at least authorize us,
the Anti-Demon Bureau, to act as venue security?

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:56.780
That is something
we'd like to ask of you, as well.

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.780
We will also make sure to drop a line
with the chief of Metropolitan Police later.

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:02.700
That will help out a lot.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.160
Take care.

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:07.040
However...

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:11.710
we do ask you to keep combat
inside the venue at an absolute minimum.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:15.970
If a commotion like the one that happened
at the Legeston Hotel the other day happens again...

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:19.300
It was a pain to cover all of that up!

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:25.520
So?

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:27.810
Well, it's what you'd expect.

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:30.440
Please dispatch your personnel right away.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:33.400
Is it okay for us
to take on the entire job?

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:38.780
There'll be no competitor's auction
because a Demon Hazard hasn't been confirmed.

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:44.120
By discretion of the Anti-Demon Bureau,
we'll treat this as a bid for AAA via designation.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:46.000
Leave it to us.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:51.540
I think I can buy combat power that can
destroy them, city hall and all, for a cheap price.

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:57.300
If that is true, I would like you
to refrain at all costs.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.850
I don't see anyone suspicious for now.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:13.230
<i>Roger. I'd like you to continue
surveillance of the area around the venue.</i>

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:17.400
That said, about the case
I asked about earlier...

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:22.740
<i>Rest assured. $3,000 for the both of you.
I paid the full sum up front by direct deposit.</i>

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.080
Appreciate it!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:30.920
Huh?

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:32.960
Hey, Shu!

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:36.050
What's with that outfit?
A rite of passage?

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:37.510
Miles!

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:42.720
<i>So Ayano...</i>

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.600
<i>Nothing abnormal on your end?</i>

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.680
There's something terribly abnormal!

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:48.680
What's with this outfit
that's so hard to move around in?

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.350
<i>You should rejoice.</i>

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:54.100
<i>This is a rare opportunity to wear
formal clothing and write it off as an expense.</i>

00:11:55.400 --> 00:12:00.030
That girl's dress
isn't part of our expenses, is it?

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:09.700
Oh, Kisara!

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:11.290
You decided to drop by!

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:14.080
M-Mikhail-senpai?

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:17.750
Mmm... That dress
is absolutely fabulous on you!

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:20.130
You're as lovely as I thought, Kisara!

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:22.590
And hurray to myself
for picking it out for you!

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:26.680
U-Um, being invited here today...

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:29.220
A stranger!
Why are you such a stranger!

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:31.480
Think of the relationship between us!

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:36.110
Is that the rumored leftovers,
the youngest of the Hachisuka family?

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:41.530
The mayor's first wife was the daughter
of the head of the Yang Conglomerate.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:46.070
The second wife, the mother, was a distant relative
to president of Russia at the time of marriage.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:50.950
You can tell just how much countries
all over the world are interested in this city.

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:53.080
Such a heartwarming episode.

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:56.000
A demon agent?

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.290
Yeah.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:02.420
I don't know the details myself, but my boss
has been after him for the longest time.

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:07.800
The suspect for this case has been
a self-proclaimed activist for a while,

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:09.760
but he only made outcries on the internet.

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:14.850
He didn't have the guts nor the connections to make
anything happen. Just a worthless shut-in student.

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:15.850
Ah...

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:22.610
But he suddenly cooked up an elaborate plan
for terrorism and disappeared.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:26.450
We mobilized every cop in Bayron,
but we can't even get a lead on where he is.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:29.410
So you think he made a contract
with that agent guy

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:33.250
and gained the power
and knowledge of a demon?

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:42.170
Yeah, enticing him with smooth-talking
even if he didn't really wish to do so.

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:46.050
So in the end, we're just getting rid
of the tip of the iceberg?

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:50.050
Yeah. So if we can find
the line that connects up,

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:54.140
we might be able to mobilize
before the Demon Hazard even happens.

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:57.520
That's what my boss thinks at least.

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:03.570
You know that the police is no match
against Demon Possessions

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:08.610
because of the worst law in the history
of Bayron, the Heavy Weapons Act.

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:12.080
We have to use our heads,
unlike you PMCs.

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:13.330
Oh.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:18.750
It looks like our great mayor
is going to grace us with his speech now.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.960
Then, I guess we go back to our posts.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:27.420
Come to think of it, Shu,
you should come eat at our place sometime.

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:30.260
Melissa's been wanting
to see you, too, you know.

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:31.850
Melissa?

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:35.930
Come on, have you forgotten
the name of my daughter?

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:40.810
You lived together with us
for about a year when you were a kid.

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:43.610
That's right.

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:46.400
Jeez.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.490
Well, I'll see you later.

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:49.820
Miles!

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.320
Hmm?

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:56.120
I'm terribly sorry to ask this,
but if I could have one more...

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.130
Thanks!

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:04.880
In the past...

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:10.510
my father Yoshiteru Hachisuka
floated a city on the Pacific Ocean...

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:15.350
to make the first step of a voyage
toward an unclear future.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:20.770
It has been 25 years since,
and this island that he named "Bayron City"

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:24.690
can be called "the center of global economy"
without exaggeration.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:28.360
Every citizen has a chance here!

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:31.410
This is a city where every citizen
is promised success!

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:35.490
Capitalists, entrepreneurs, politicians...

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:38.830
Every individual
is paying the most attention...

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:40.620
to this very place,

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.960
Bayron City!

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:47.210
Cheers to Bayron City!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:52.300
But there are still people
who struggle to find food to eat today.

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:56.140
That's just having
a worthless head of the household.

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:58.810
That said...

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:04.480
how dare he say
every citizen is promised success.

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:07.190
That's right. Deception.

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:10.240
Those that once sought success in this city

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:14.570
and had their dreams dashed
have fallen into underground society.

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:20.370
They've soiled their hands with crime
and have a part in the devastation of this city.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:24.460
Bayron City is supported by Orgonium.

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:29.420
This ultimate clean energy resource
will bring to all humanity fortune, prosperity,

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:33.800
peace and safety
as a treasure of the world!

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:37.260
<i>In order to protect this sacred energy,</i>

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:42.140
<i>this city must continue
to be an eternal paradise!</i>

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:44.850
Paradise, my ass.

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.730
A city so full of demons...

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:49.190
A paradise...

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:52.360
You say that's what massacred
my entire family?

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:54.240
That's right.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.070
Everything about this is deception.

00:16:56.620 --> 00:17:00.080
The mayor is hiding the existence
of demons that haunt this city

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:02.960
from the citizens and from the world.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:08.840
That's why I will expose their existence
to all citizens and the entire world.

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:13.170
And I will kill the mayor
with my own hands to do so!

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:15.760
How was that, Kisara?

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:18.470
My dad's glorious speech—

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.350
Huh?

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:23.480
Wha...

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:36.360
Seal the venue!

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:37.950
Don't let anyone out for a while!

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.980
I knew you were going to head down to escape.

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:23.580
You know that's not gonna work!

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:31.130
Why are you getting in our way?

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:34.880
You have something to say
against that mayor, too, don't you?

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:39.680
What are you doing?

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:47.350
I WENT ALL OUT PLAYING
WITH A 1-MONTH-OLD KITTEN

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.350
<i>Tickle, tickle! Boo!</i>

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:49.770
<i>Tickle, tickle! Boo!</i>

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:02.870
Thanks for working overtime,
Mr. Public Servant.

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:09.250
This is what you'd call "checkmate."

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.090
Oh, Boss?

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:16.550
Good timing.
We're just about wrapping up.

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:18.470
Huh?

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:19.630
Change of plans?

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:21.970
Wait, what does that mean—

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.010
Yes.

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:24.930
Yes.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.890
What's wrong, Shu?

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:32.270
We can't kill it for any reason.
We must catch it alive.

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:33.980
Huh? Why?

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:40.150
Apparently, that guy still has his human mind
left even after becoming a Demon Possession.

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:40.150
You! And you, too!

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.110
Why are you siding with the organization?

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:44.120
The police wants to interrogate him
and investigate into his background.

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:44.120
Why are you acting
as dogs for the government?

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:47.410
What? I'm not good at hitting
with the back of my sword.

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:50.790
I-I don't have any gear
for capturing on, either.

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.920
He's going to keep the existence
of us demons hidden

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:58.460
and monopolize the rights to Orgonium
and wrestling money from the world!

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:01.090
ELECTRIC NET LAUNCHER
(FOR 40MM WEAPONS)

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:02.300
Is it all right to let this greed-filled city
keep running like this?

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:01.090
PROCEED TO
CHECKOUT

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:04.140
ORDER TOTAL

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:04.140
YOUR CART

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:04.140
Man, the express delivery is expensive!

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:06.350
Hold on, Shu!

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.390
The total says $3,000.

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:12.440
Yeah. Looks like we'll have to use
all of today's payment for this.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:14.860
Then, we have no reason to be working.

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:17.150
How about you become
a bit more conscious about costs?

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:20.610
You say that, but if we fail
our mission here,

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:19.650
You're a Demon Possession, too, right?

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:24.570
Side with us! Let's change this
rotten city with our own hands!

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:22.860
they might not give us
work next time.

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:30.620
Do you understand that we aren't able to live
our daily lives because you use money like that?

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.870
Why do you seek allegiance with them?

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:34.420
Didn't they cover up...

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:37.460
stuff about your family, too?

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:44.890
CONFIRM ORDER

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:47.180
You can't! Shu, don't do it!

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:49.640
I can't afford to let it get away!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:53.480
What about us living at minimum levels
of healthy, civilized lives?

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:55.860
Kisara...

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:57.190
CONFIRM ORDER

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:00.780
I love...

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:02.700
your bean sprout cooking!

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:03.150
CONFIRM ORDER

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:03.700
ORDER COMPLETE

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:24.880
This is Bayron City Express.

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:28.800
I'm here to deliver the item you ordered.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:33.770
I think I just lost the need for it.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:48.990
Hey, Shu...

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:51.370
Hmm?

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:56.370
Didn't a little bit of what he said sting you?

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:59.000
<i>Why do you seek allegiance with them?</i>

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:02.550
<i>Didn't they cover up
stuff about your family, too?</i>

00:22:07.180 --> 00:22:12.470
But I currently get jobs
from that very government.

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:17.900
That said, what should we do
for the next month starting tomorrow?

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:21.320
Hmm. Oh, I found 50 cents!

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:24.240
That's two bags of bean sprouts at the most.

00:23:55.620 --> 00:24:00.040
EPISODE 3
THE SLIGHTEST TERRIBLE COST

00:23:56.790 --> 00:23:59.330
"The Slightest Terrible Cost."
